s=\"l\">\r\n\r\n                    <span id=\"pubtime_baidu\">2026/6/4 6:47:49</span>\r\n                    <span id=\"source_baidu\">来源：<a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/0/959/585.htm\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a></span>\r\n                    <span id=\"author_baidu\">作者：<strong>远洋</strong></span>\r\n\r\n                    <span id=\"editor_baidu\">责编：<strong>远洋</strong></span>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"r\">\r\n\r\n                <span id=\"hitcount\"></span>\r\n                    <a href=\"#post_comm\" class=\"pti_comm\">评论：<span id=\"commentcount\"></span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"post_content \" id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            <div class='tougao-user' >感谢IT之家网友 <a href='https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D795776' rel='nofollow'>風見暉一</a>、<a href='https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2135629' rel='nofollow'>江山已旧</a>、<a href='https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D1234004' rel='nofollow'>对的时间点</a>、<a href='https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2029428' rel='nofollow'>华南吴彦祖</a> 的线索投递！</div>\r\n            <p data-vmark=\"33bc\"><a class=\"s_tag\" href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 6 月 4 日消息，北京时间周四凌晨，分析师郭明錤发帖称，苹果 XR 头显和智能眼镜路线图中仅剩两款智能眼镜产品可见。</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"fbeb\"><img src=\"//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png\" w=\"1440\" h=\"810\" data-vmark=\"3ce3\" class=\"lazy\" title=\"郭明錤：苹果路线图已移除 Vision Pro 系列，专注 AI 眼镜\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/6/9c961261-8288-476b-9350-c96c6d8773f2.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"461\"></p><p data-vmark=\"b551\">郭明錤还表示，这次重大调整由苹果下一任 CEO 约翰 · 特努斯（John Ternus）批准。这一转变实际上已经发生一段时间了。对于 Vision Pro 产品线被移除，郭明錤直言这是正确的决定，苹果应当把资源转向具有更广大消费潜力的 AI 眼镜品类。</p><p data-vmark=\"8dc2\">郭明錤称，最新的供应链调查显示，苹果配备光学波导显示屏的苹果 AR / XR 智能眼镜设备（由光学波导驱动）已推迟至 2029 年。类似于 Ray-Ban Meta 的无显示屏 AI 眼镜仍预计于 2027 年出货。</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"17dc\"><img src=\"//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png\" w=\"656\" h=\"868\" data-mpos=\"2,0\" data-vmark=\"d083\" class=\"lazy\" title=\"郭明錤：苹果路线图已移除 Vision Pro 系列，专注 AI 眼镜\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/6/03c303ff-5304-4250-887a-1309a0ddcb49.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"656\" height=\"868\"></p><p data-vmark=\"5676\">IT之家注意到，马克 · 古尔曼此前透露，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ithome.com/0/957/907.htm\">苹果更轻薄的 Vision Pro 新品预计将于 2028 年末或 2029 年正式亮相</a>。</p><p class=\"ad-tips\">广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家所有文章均包含本声明。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"newserror\">\r\n                <button class=\"water\" data-nid=\"959585\">投诉水文</button>\r\n                <button class=\"error\" data-nid=\"959585\">我要纠错</button>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"newsgrade\"></div>\r\n        <div class=\"shareto\">\r\n            \r\n            <div class=\"bdsharebuttonbox\">\r\n                <a href=\"https://connect.qq.com/widget/shareqq/index.html?url=https%3a%2f%2fwww.ithome.com%2f0%2f959%2f585.htm&title=%e9%83%ad%e6%98%8e%e9%8c%a4%ef%bc%9a%e8%8b%b9%e6%9e%9c%e8%b7%af%e7%ba%bf%e5%9b%be%e5%b7%b2%e7%a7%bb%e9%99%a4+Vision+Pro+%e7%b3%bb%e5%88%97%ef%bc%8c%e4%b8%93%e6%b3%a8+AI+%e7%9c%bc%e9%95%9c&summary=\" class=\"bds_qzone\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"分享到QQ\"></a>\r\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"bds_weixin\" data-cmd=\"weixin\" title=\"分享到微信\"></a>\r\n                <a href=\"https://service.weibo.com/share/share.php?url=https%3a%2f%2fwww.ithome.com%2f0%2f959%2f585.htm&title=%e9%83%ad%e6%98%8e%e9%8c%a4%ef%bc%9a%e8%8b%b9%e6%9e%9c%e8%b7%af%e7%ba%bf%e5%9b%be%e5%b7%b2%e7%a7%bb%e9%99%a4+Vision+Pro+%e7%b3%bb%e5%88%97%ef%bc%8c%e4%b8%93%e6%b3%a8+AI+%e7%9c%bc%e9%95%9c\" target=\"_b